# BUGS

A pin's function is left as firmware or a pin state set it: the driver doesn't set it to GPIO through k1-pinctrl(3).
Nothing reads the controller's interrupts, its edges or its masks: a GPIO can't interrupt, so an SD card's detect pin isn't watched.
